#: props.py:65
msgid "Select whether the proxy is generated by the target (as the start frame or current frame), or use another object as the proxy"
msgstr "选择代理是由目标生成（作为起始帧或当前帧），还是使用其他物体作为代理"

#: props.py:71
msgid "Selected Object"
msgstr "选定物体"

#: panels.py:179
msgid "Selected collection contains no valid mesh objects"
msgstr "选定的集合不包含有效的网格物体"

#: props.py:33
msgid "Selected object acts as proxy - which can be thought of as a deformation basis. This will become the static mesh which vat encoding is relative to. Custom Proxy MUST have the exact vert count/order as the Target. Automatic Edge splitting is not applied to proxy objects."
msgstr "选定物体作为代理——可将其视为变形基准。它将成为 VAT 编码所相对的静态网格。自定义代理必须与目标具有完全相同的顶点数量和顺序。自动边拆分不会应用于代理物体。"

#: props.py:118
msgid "Selected object acts as proxy to active object. If False, uses frame 1 as proxy deformation"
msgstr "选定物体作为活动物体的代理。若为假，则使用第 1 帧作为代理变形"

#: props.py:181
msgid "Separate Map"
msgstr "分离贴图"

#: props.py:27
msgid "Show encoding details based on your current settings. This is based on currently realized data only, results may vary if vertex count changes when geometry's modifiers are applied during encoding process. Estimated min/max is shown when using automatic normal-safe edges and is determined at time of encoding"
msgstr "根据当前设置显示编码详情。仅基于当前已实现的数据；若编码过程中应用几何体修改器导致顶点数变化，结果可能不同。使用自动法线安全边时会显示估计的最小值/最大值，并在编码时确定"

#: panels.py:270
msgid "Single Row Mode Enabled"
msgstr "已启用单行模式"

#: props.py:82
msgid "Splits the resulting mesh on all sharp edges to provide proper per-vertex normal data (does not affect face count, increases final mesh vertex count along identified edges). Target geometry (source) is unaffected"
msgstr "在所有锐边上拆分生成的网格，以提供正确的逐顶点法线数据（不影响面数，会增加识别边上的最终网格顶点数）。目标几何体（源）不受影响"

